{"sections":[{"slug":"拓扑场论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拓扑场论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑场论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拓扑场论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑场论</span></strong> (topological field theory) <span lang=\"zh\">是由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">出发</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">取值于某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个幺半函子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">通常</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶线性范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即线性空间范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Vect}_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的高阶类比</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}